<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **3.625     MATURITY  **20.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 20.OCT.97 WHEN COUPON STEPS UP T 4.2 PCT IF</p>
<p>		NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 1190</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
